            "review_title": "Review at Papa Steak",
            "review_text": "Safari27012658059\n1 contribution\n0\nA very bad experience in Papasteak\nJul 2026 • Family\nA very disappointing evening at Papasteak. My home is very popular in Papasteak because the quality of food is very good with reasonable prices. But it was too bad, and that bad thing should be the most basic thing of any restaurant. When the food is fully disposed, a very necessary thing like a bowl is missing. At first I informed the restaurant very gently, but for 15 minutes waiting for the results, I could still skip and repeat the second time (because my house is still eating dishes that don't need to bowl). But a long time later, when the food began to shrink, it was time for people to switch over to eating the main dishes like rice, steak, pasta and then there was a bowl to eat. During that time, my house had to use the small cups of other parts of food to eat. So I mentioned the third time about the bowl. It took me five minutes before I got a cup to eat rice, but I don’t understand how a prestigious restaurant like Papasteak could make up a cup. Partly because I could expect a large restaurant like Papasteak to give my guests a dish, and partly because my mother was so abstaining from dishes and cared about meals, and most importantly, I was so disappointed with Papasteak’s service today. (And I also noticed that I didn't see the manager anywhere all day:)) Hopefully Papasteak can read it and fix it soon, if k, then I will really lose all confidence in Papasteak.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 17, 2026",
